close_reason: "DELIVERED: merged PR #164 (24fe1f25d8fd275b0bfd74090d0044f16f2a6823) is an ancestor of audited main 9c887a56a99c7108591d9f223d09e3937ecf3e55. Inspected on main: test/deadline-repair.test.ts, docs/deadline-repair-validation.md. Minimal capacity/scope repairs use existing infeasible scheduling, preserve forbidden moves/prerequisites/horizons and honest exhausted-search refusals; no-git SDK/CLI/public-copy and full npm/Bun gates are retained. This tracker audit inspected existing tests/files; it does not claim a new full product test run."
body: "Acceptance: Every proposed repair makes the scenario feasible; forbidden moves are excluded; no automatic deadline or dependency edits. Deliver a typed SDK and CLI, compact TOON/JSON, typed refusals with remedies, README and example, no-git regression and read-only public-tracker validation. Use targeted local tests/typecheck/lint and unchanged npm plus Bun release gates in CI."
